                  "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b",
                  "tools": [],
                  "remember": false,
                  "system": "You convert a salon booking request into ERP ids. Output exactly one line and nothing else.\nEither: branchId=<branch_id>&serviceId=<service_id>&date=<YYYY-MM-DD>&guestCount=<number>\nOr the single word AMBIGUOUS when the customer's words fit more than one service (e.g. two techniques named together).\nOr the single word NOMATCH when the service or branch does not clearly match exactly one entry, the branch is not ACTIVE, the date cannot be resolved, or a value is missing.",
                  "text": "Customer message: {{last_input}}\nGuest values (may be empty or loosely worded): service={{avail_service}} | branch={{avail_branch}} | date={{avail_date}} | guests={{avail_guests}}\nCurrent time: {{current_user_time}}\nBookable services (JSON): {{avail_services_json}}\nBranches (JSON): {{avail_branches_json}}\nMatch the service and branch by meaning against the lists. Guests often shorten names: initials, abbreviations, missing accents or typos. Match those too. Resolve relative dates (today, tomorrow, a weekday) from the current time. guestCount defaults to 1 only if guests is empty.",
